WEBVTT

00:06:58.454 --> 00:07:01.954
srebrnog vola,

00:07:03.163 --> 00:07:06.204
da, ok, crvenog magarca,

00:07:06.663 --> 00:07:08.371
a što je bilo zeleno?

00:07:09.663 --> 00:07:12.454
Pijetao, smaragdni pijetao.

00:07:12.829 --> 00:07:13.829
Ok.

00:07:14.038 --> 00:07:16.288
A sad trenutak istine, Gwen,

00:07:16.954 --> 00:07:18.204
zavirit ćemo u omotnicu.

00:07:18.246 --> 00:07:22.204
Otvorite i uzmite komad papira
iz nje i dodajte mi ga

00:07:22.538 --> 00:07:25.121
pa ćemo vidjeti odgovara li Vašem izboru.

00:07:26.913 --> 00:07:28.329
Da, mislim da odgovara.

00:07:28.329 --> 00:07:29.913
Kobaltni konj, crveni magarac,

00:07:29.913 --> 00:07:32.246
imamo žutu sovu,
zelenog pijetla, srebrnog vola.